P875A02: present-path diagnostics for the black screen.

P875A02fb_dump=1 logs the first pixels and the centre pixel of the presented
surface for the first swaps; P875A02fb_test=1 paints colour bars into the panel
on the first frames instead of copying, to prove the present path.

